I just downloaded the 33 parts of nethack3pl8 from uunet.uu.net and much
to my dismay found that part30 was actually the same as part32.  There 
were also other problems like the messages of "still need to unpack parts:"
being innacurate.  I didn't look through all the files to see if the rest
of them were ok, but I wasn't able to find part30 anywhere on uunet.  Has
anyone else seen this (or other problems) or does anyone know who I can 
inform about the problem (if I haven't already).  I did get path level 8
from linc.cis.upenn.edu so I am allright, but I would like to warn anyone
else who is trying to build it from the sources at uunet that you may 
be causing yourself undue headache.

						
